  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) INSTINCTIVE HUNTERS (Da Big Hunt) at the end of the OPPONENT's Fight phase through the real fight_phase_end window and the strategic_reserves follow-up. Fixture ork11e_orks_reactive (P1 Custodes ACTIVE, P2 Orks), detachment switched to Da Big Hunt (setup privilege, stratagems reloaded). Setup privilege: the Beast Snagga Boyz are repositioned unengaged in the Orks' corner, within 6\" of the battlefield edge. The players end the Custodes' Fight phase with the real End Fight Phase button / confirmation dialogs and pass both halves of the Consolidate step; the fight_phase_end window opens for the active Custodes first (nothing to offer) and then for PLAYER 2: the StratagemDialog shows INSTINCTIVE HUNTERS on the Beast Snagga Boyz (enabled Use) while the hot-seat overlay names Player 2. A real click spends P2's CP and the follow-up places the unit in strategic reserves (IN_RESERVES / strategic_reserves, flagged as a repositioned unit so the end-of-round-3 cull spares it); its tokens leave the board.",
